          "evidence": "S may be empty: then V={0}, C\u00b0={0}, V_+\u2216{0}=\u2205 and both sides of the criterion fail at v=0, so steps 1.2-1.3 are vacuous while steps 2.1 and 3.1-4.1 still hold; the statement is verified for this case."
