          "evidence": "The forward direction of (1), \u2113(ws)>\u2113(w) \u27f9 \u03c1(w)e_s\u2208\u03a6_+, is step 1.2, obtained through the equivalence with \u03c1(w)e_s\u2208\u03a6_-."
        },
